SUMMARY:Special Event: Colin Quinn
LOCATION:Philadelphia
DESCRIPTION:COLIN QUINN  is a stand-up comedian from Brooklyn (okay\, Park
  Slope)\, who has been a part of your whole life even though you never aske
 d for it. From MTV’s “Remote Control” to "SNL" to Comedy Central’s 
 “Tough Crowd with Colin Quinn\,” Mr. Quinn is not one to take a hint an
 d bow out gracefully. He’s been on Broadway with "Colin Quinn: An Irish W
 ake" and "Colin Quinn: Long Story Short" and Off-Broadway with his shows "C
 olin Quinn: Unconstitutional\," "Colin Quinn: The New York Story" (directed
  by Jerry Seinfeld)\, "Colin Quinn: Red State\, Blue State\," and most rece
 ntly\, "Colin Quinn: The Last Best Hope." Recent credits include "Trainwrec
 k\," "Girls\," and his web series “Cop Show\,” streaming now on Colin
 ’s YouTube channel. His last book\, “Overstated: A Coast-to-Coast Roast
  of the 50 States\,” is out now from Macmillan Publishing.\n\nManagement 
 reserves the right to prevent customers from entering the facility who they
  deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedya
 tlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event-colin-quinn-21335/
